ipv4rule from trust to untrust srcip 10.10.0.221-10.10.0.255 dstip 0.0.0.0/0 action acc service FWS_https log no prior 4
ipv4rule from trust to untrust srcip 10.10.0.221-10.10.0.255 dstip 0.0.0.0/0 action acc service FWS_tcp_53 log no prior 4
