ipv4rule from trust to dmz srcip 10.10.0.50/31 dstip 0.0.0.0/0 action acc service FWS_ssh log no prior 4
ipv4rule from trust to lab srcip 10.10.0.50/31 dstip 0.0.0.0/0 action acc service FWS_ssh log no prior 4
ipv4rule from dmz to trust srcip 0.0.0.0/0 dstip 10.10.0.60 action acc service FWS_syslog log no prior 4
ipv4rule from lab to untrust srcip 10.30.0.0/24 dstip 0.0.0.0/0 action acc service FWS_https log no prior 4
