exit
firewallnat
napt srcint untrust proto tcp type ipv4 dstip 203.0.113.3 transip 10.20.0.10 dstport 80 transport 80
napt srcint untrust proto tcp type ipv4 dstip 203.0.113.3 transip 10.20.0.10 dstport 443 transport 443
src-nat srcint lab dstint untrust type ipv4 srcip 10.30.0.0/24 dstip 0.0.0.0/0 transip auto
exit
end
